  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Cotton_Candy?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/67/Cotton_Candy.png/revision/latest?cb=20240210053918\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cotton Candy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 75</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 226</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  30 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 27</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2e/Candy_Machine.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925204735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Candy Machine\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 63</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Cotton Candy</b> (also known as candy floss) is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 75. It's not used to make any other product.\n</p><p>It is introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/version-history-34971\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Version History\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">28 June 2021 update</a>.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making cotton candy</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Candy Machine\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Candy Machine\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2e/Candy_Machine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250925204735\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ACandy_Machine.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Cotton candy is made in <a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine</a>.\n</p><p>To make cotton candy, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/white-sugar-2096\" title=\"White Sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White Sugar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/white-sugar-2096\" title=\"White Sugar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White Sugar\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/ff/White_Sugar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20240205163815\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">White Sugar</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/strawberry-2240\" title=\"Strawberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Strawberry\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/strawberry-2240\" title=\"Strawberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Strawberry\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6d/Strawberry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20240219031821\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Strawberry</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>×3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>×1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 30 minutes to make one cotton candy, and 25 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> candy machine. Each cotton candy gives players 27 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling candy floss</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191028143054\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ARoadside_Shop.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Cotton candy can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2268 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 units.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make 1 cotton candy costs 200 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Producing a cotton candy requires 3 bags of white sugar. Nevertheless, they never be requested to fill carte of boat. Players don't need to produce reservation.</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-candy-machine-products-7556\" title=\"Category:Candy Machine Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/caramel-apple-2515\" title=\"Caramel Apple\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Caramel Apple\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-2523\" title=\"Chocolate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cotton-candy-34965\" title=\"Cotton Candy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cotton Candy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/honey-peanuts-33953\" title=\"Honey Peanuts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey Peanuts\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/jelly-beans-2519\" title=\"Jelly Beans\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Jelly Beans\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lollipop-2521\" title=\"Lollipop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lollipop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/sesame-brittle-31889\" title=\"Sesame Brittle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sesame Brittle\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/toffee-2512\" title=\"Toffee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Toffee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030639\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 886/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5778/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 955/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 861492/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.716      1 -total\n 70.79%   45.103      1 Template:Infobox\n 30.44%   19.394      8 Template:Infoicon\n 19.36%   12.334      1 Template:Navigation\n 11.63%    7.410      1 Template:CandyMachineMenu\n  2.64%    1.681      1 Template:Languages\n  2.25%    1.435      3 Template:Clr\n  1.85%